Consider adding error handling around the fetch call in #executeRequest to gracefully handle network exceptions.
```suggestion
    try {
      return await fetch(request);
    } catch (error) {
      this.#app.log.error('Network request failed', error);
      throw error; // Rethrow the error to ensure it is handled by the caller
    }
```

