<details>
<summary>🤖 Prompt for AI Agents</summary>

```
In packages/frontend/core/src/desktop/pages/workspace/all-page/all-page.tsx
around lines 346 to 354, the call to collectionService.updateCollection is
asynchronous but not awaited, causing errors to be silently swallowed. Modify
handleSaveFilters to be async, await the updateCollection call, and wrap it in a
try-catch block to handle and surface any errors properly. Apply the same
async-await and error handling pattern to the "create-and-pin" branch inside
openPromptModal to ensure consistent error management.
```

</details>

