**CONDITIONAL RENDERING FOR PDF GENERATION: REQUIRES ENHANCEMENT.**

CONDITIONAL RENDERING OF STATION NAMES IN PDF CONTENT IS CORRECT. HOWEVER, FILENAME GENERATION AT LINE 267 DOES NOT APPLY SAME CONDITIONAL LOGIC.

```diff
-        doc.save(`metro-ticket-${ticketData.ticketId}-${ticketData.originStationName} to ${ticketData.destinationStationName}.pdf`);
+        let filename = `metro-ticket-${ticketData.ticketId}`;
+        if (ticketData.destinationStationName) {
+            filename += `-${ticketData.originStationName} to ${ticketData.destinationStationName}`;
+        } else {
+            filename += `-rapidpass`;
+        }
+        doc.save(`${filename}.pdf`);
```


