**`.incoming` / `.outgoing` classes are now empty – alignment is lost**

These placeholders no longer apply any layout, so all bubbles align identically. If the intent is still left/right separation, add back the flex styles:

```diff
.incoming {
-}
+  flex-direction: row;
+  justify-content: flex-start;
+}

.outgoing {
-}
+  flex-direction: row-reverse;
+  justify-content: flex-end;
+}
```

Without this, the UI regresses visually.  



