review_comment:
To put it simply, with the current approach:

```
onPropertyChanged: {
    if (!deck.playing) {
        deck.loadTrack(myTrack)
    }
}
```

will load the track only if no track is playing on `deck`

```
onPropertyChanged: {
    if (!deck.playing) {
        deck.currentTrack = myTrack
    }
}
```

Will load the track only if no track is playing on `deck`, and then will load the track inconditionally, whenever `myTrack` changes. This means you now need to take care of the business logic in C++, so a user that would want to customize this needs a new Mixxx build, as opposite to be able to adjust this `if`

