review_comment:
how about use BoundedDeque trait , I'd prefer this:
```
trait BoundedDeque<T> {
    fn push_bounded(&mut self, item: T, max_len: usize);
}

impl<T> BoundedDeque<T> for VecDeque<T> {
    fn push_bounded(&mut self, item: T, max_len: usize) {
        if self.len() >= max_len {
            self.pop_front();
        }
        self.push_back(item);
    }
}
```

